users/felipe_xom","html_url":"https://github.com/felipe_xom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipe_xom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-01-29T13:50:35Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2622207572","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/32261#issuecomment-2622207572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/32261","id":2622207572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks6cS7ZU","user":{"login":"josephsavona","id":6425824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU4MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6425824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona","html_url":"https://github.com/josephsavona","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T17:01:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-29T17:01:16Z","body":"Thanks for posting about this. In this case, the compiler cannot know what the `renderVideo(videoRef)` call is doing. It doesn't know whether that function will access the `videoRef.current` or not, but realistically most such functions are likely to do so (if all you can do is store a reference to `videoRef` itself, then there's not much a helper function can do). Therefore, we report an error since you are likely violating the rule about accessing refs during render.\n\nI'll leave this open as a reminder for us to improve the error message to make this more clear.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2622207572/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"josephsavona","id":6425824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU4MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6425824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona","html_url":"https://github.com/josephsavona","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josephsavona/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2624276959","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/32261#issuecomment-2624276959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/32261","id":2624276959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks6ca0nf","user":{"login":"fdelu","id":71850278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODUwMjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71850278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu","html_url":"https://github.com/fdelu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T11:49:52Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T11:49:52Z","body":"> Thanks for posting about this. In this case, the compiler cannot know what the `renderVideo(videoRef)` call is doing. It doesn't know whether that function will access the `videoRef.current` or not, but realistically most such functions are likely to do so (if all you can do is store a reference to `videoRef` itself, then there's not much a helper function can do). Therefore, we report an error since you are likely violating the rule about accessing refs during render.\n> \n> I'll leave this open as a reminder for us to improve the error message to make this more clear.\n\nSounds good. As a workaround then, I'll pass the child component type as a prop instead of passing a render function. Thank you for the explanation!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2624276959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"fdelu","id":71850278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODUwMjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71850278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu","html_url":"https://github.com/fdelu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdelu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":16151334932,"node_id":"SE_lADOAJy2Ks6n-5JrzwAAAAPCsdAU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/events/16151334932","actor":{"login":"GabbeV","id":13839236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODM5MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13839236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabbeV","html_url":"https://github.com/GabbeV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabbeV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabbeV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabbeV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabbeV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.